meta {
  name: saveProductCategory
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductCategory",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "product_category_id": 7
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Link a product to a category

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_id` | integer | yes | ID of the product to link to the category |
  | `product_category_id` | integer | yes | ID of the category to link the product to |

  **Example: Add product to category**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductCategory",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "product_category_id": 7
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "product_category_id": 7
  }
  ```
}
